Sephetho ngola: (['a:b:'] - [':']), mola-o-mocha.
Sephetho ngola: (['Lorem Ipsum'] - ['Ipsum']), mola-o-mocha.
Sephetho ngola: (['a.................b.......................c...........'] - ['.']), mola-o-mocha.
Sephetho ngola: (['a--b--c---d'] - ['--']), mola-o-mocha.
Sephetho ngola: (['-'] - ['--']), mola-o-mocha.
Sephetho ngola: ([''] - ['--']), mola-o-mocha.
Sephetho ngola: (['--'] - ['']), mola-o-mocha.
Sephetho ngola: ([''] - ['']), mola-o-mocha.
>> x := ['xx'].
>> y := x - ['x'].
Sephetho ngola: x, mola-o-mocha.
Sephetho ngola: y, mola-o-mocha.
>> x := ['a,bb,c'].
>> y := x nkela-sebaka: [''] ka: ['xx'].
Sephetho ngola: ((x ea-tšoanang: y) ena: ['OK'] kapa-eane: ['BUG! Did return a copy by accident!']), mola-o-mocha.